**Theorem 269.2 (The minimum over the entire fibre).**
For the fibre (269.1),

$$
\min_{Q(Y)=(\beta;K),\,Y\ge0}\Delta_N(Y)
=\min_{Q(Y)=(\beta;K),\,Y\ge0}\Delta_O(Y)=\frac{4s}{3}.
\tag{269.2}
$$

